"91425" spcFirstLastPara="1" rIns="91425" wrap="square" tIns="45700"><a:noAutofit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:pPr indent="0" lvl="0" marL="0" marR="0" rtl="0" algn="ctr"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="100000"/></a:lnSpc><a:spcBef><a:spcPts val="0"/></a:spcBef><a:spcAft><a:spcPts val="0"/></a:spcAft><a:buClr><a:srgbClr val="2FB0DC"/></a:buClr><a:buSzPts val="4000"/><a:buFont typeface="Calibri"/><a:buNone/></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr b="1" i="0" lang="en-US" sz="4000" u="none" cap="none" strike="noStrike"><a:solidFill><a:srgbClr val="2FB0DC"/></a:solidFill><a:latin typeface="Calibri"/><a:ea typeface="Calibri"/><a:cs typeface="Calibri"/><a:sym typeface="Calibri"/></a:rPr><a:t>Prototypical G-protein: Ras</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr/></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:pic><p:nvPicPr><p:cNvPr descr="The Ras protein, which is the prototype for all G proteins, comprises several white, green, purple, and red looped ribbons mildly connected at a central point.&#xA;The Ras protein, which is the prototype for all G proteins, comprises several white, green, purple, and red looped ribbons mildly connected at a central point. The structure is predominantly formed by a series of white coiled ribbons connected to other colored coils. To the bottom right is a green coil labeled Switch II. Next to that is a purple looped tube labeled P loop, which intersects with a red looped tube labeled Switch I. That intersects with a looped white tube, which has section colored in light green and labeled Ala146, which gives specificity for GTP over ATP.  To the bottom left, there’s a large white coiled ribbon that has a section colored purple, and at the top of that is a green circle labeled Mg21-GTP, and held by critical residues in the bluish-purple phosphate-binding P loop and by Thr35 in Switch I  and Gly60 in Switch II. To the top left of the coils are extensions of the red, bluish-purple, and black looped lines with little balls projecting outward; this region is labeled GTP analog and is in the GTP-binding site." id="175" name="Google Shape;175;p24"/><p:cNvPicPr preferRelativeResize="0"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvPicPr><p:blipFill rotWithShape="1"><a:blip r:embed="rId3"><a:alphaModFix/></a:blip><a:srcRect b="0" l="0" r="0" t="0"/><a:stretch/></p:blipFill><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="2209800" y="963612"/><a:ext cx="5181600" cy="5721350"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/><a:ln><a:noFill/></a:ln></p:spPr></p:pic></p:spTree></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>